<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Telerj 1996 net 64.16 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brazil Telerj 1996 net 64.16 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rio de Janeiro state telecom company Telerj issued the following statement on its 1996 results calculated according to non-inflationary adjusted methods:</p>
<p>						 1996		     1995</p>
<p> Net operational rev		     1.25 bln		  n/a</p>
<p> Net result		  64.16 million profit	111.58 million loss</p>
<p>Note: No per shares figures were provided. All figures are in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
